================================================================================
GAME DATA
================================================================================

Asset licensing policy, approved sources, and the intake checklist are documented
in docs/ASSETS.md. That document is authoritative; this file records only what is
actually shipped.

OpenFPS ships only game data licensed CC0 1.0, MIT, or BSD 2/3-clause. See
docs/ASSETS.md section 3 for the full policy and the rationale for excluding
CC-BY, CC-BY-SA, and copyleft-licensed assets.

CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/) is a public-domain
dedication and imposes no attribution requirement. Contributors whose work is
listed below are credited voluntarily, as a courtesy rather than an obligation.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
No game data ships in this distribution yet.

Assets are fetched separately via `gradlew fetchAssets` and are not part of the
source tree. Each asset entering the tree is recorded here with its source,
author, license, and license URL, per the intake checklist in docs/ASSETS.md
section 7.
