NOT INCLUDED
================================================================================

OpenFPS contains no id Software content. It ships no DOOM IWAD (shareware or
retail), and no code is derived from the DOOM, Chocolate Doom, PrBoom+,
DSDA-Doom, or SLADE source releases, all of which are GPL-licensed and therefore
incompatible with this project's MIT license.

The engine's subsystem naming convention (D_, P_, R_, S_, G_, W_, Z_, I_) is an
homage to the architecture of DOOM (id Software, 1993). "DOOM" is a trademark of
id Software LLC / ZeniMax Media Inc. OpenFPS is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or derived from id Software or its products.
